OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music-making
OL,8,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,9,     FEdinburgh International Festival
OL,10,     Fand music from the European
OL,11,     Flowlands.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Schubert
OL,13,     F2/5. Kate Molleson journeys
OL,14,     Fthrough the last five years of
OL,15,     FFranz Schubert's life, focusing
OL,16,     Ftoday on the year 1825, when
OL,17,     FSchubert began his Symphony No. 9.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FJeremy Denk on performing at
OL,20,     FLammermuir Festival. Patrick
OL,21,     FSavage and Martin Cousin play
OL,22,     Flive.
