OL,8,     FHiawatha from the Edinburgh
OL,9,     FInternational Festival, with the
OL,10,     FOrchestre symphonique de Montreal
OL,11,     Fand conductor Rafael Payare.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: In Voice
OL,13,     FWhy does every voice sound
OL,14,     Fdifferent? Tenor Nicky Spence
OL,15,     Finvestigates how anatomy,
OL,16,     Flanguage, accent and technique
OL,17,     Fcombine to create our unique vocal
OL,18,     Fidentities.
